[{"client_msg_id":"a287d752-592a-4431-b2f7-bb51abba806c","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"wma音質の割にサイズ小さくてmp3プレーヤー出た頃に使ってたなぁ…\nあのころは256MBとかしか無かった…","ts":"1616072763.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dFjw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8396bc6-1108-4f71-9b69-974bc4d5b8cd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":horse:","ts":"1616070125.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X9Iz1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"058277f1-c33e-4727-94f2-57cde9598114","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"少し気になって手持ちの特典音源をチェックしてたらwmaが入っててどんな顔すればいいか分からなくなりました……","ts":"1616069946.028700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DLBar"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39de8da4-e61a-4f5b-935c-b9ed143f1d0e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いまのところmp3だけ、は特定の購入特典とかくらいかな、その場合はそれ以上の原本がないので、素直にその音源で管理します。","ts":"1616057831.026700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sGp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d138743-075b-467b-853c-9dc7e97f754c","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私もそんなに違いが分からなかったので mp3 で保存してますね。データ量的には mp3 と flac で大きな差があるので。\nPC に入れるだけなら多少大きくても構わないんですが、モバイルのデバイスだと結構効いてきます","ts":"1616057693.025800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T2X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73778553-114e-4745-9f59-faf7433cc318","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"最近のサービスだとだいたいflacかwavが選べる感じはしますね、一応\nmp3はそれはそれで辛いですけどまあそれしかないなら妥協できます\n僕の場合は一律で変換かけられるような運用ではないので","ts":"1616057187.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/weq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f125ad7d-b973-4adf-9321-b116aec242f2","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"(flac で管理してるけど mp3 でしか売ってないから買わない、的な)","ts":"1616057008.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MO4L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65f9e2b5-81e7-4739-9cf8-1bf786df536c","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"メディアによって mp3 だったり flac だったり wav だったりバラバラになってしんどくなったりすることはないです？\nそうするとそもそも購入対象にならないのかな","ts":"1616056989.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4jti"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c3d10d1-6656-4af8-ac87-d849fbbd9daf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":wakaru:  なのでポータブルに聞くなら圧縮音源でいいよね\n管理は、さまざまな都合(変換がされるかも)があるので非圧縮で持ちたい...","ts":"1616056861.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ESG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9169fc31-6aad-4526-b217-f4bc04d9e4ac","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"個人的にはデータはwavなのに2000円のイヤホンとかを使うのをやめろ、みたいな気持ちがありますが、それは人それぞれのアレ…","ts":"1616056568.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nt5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60984d6f-db70-45ed-8c9c-896723ccf8ba","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"そうですね、たぶん flac とか wav で管理している人は気分的な問題の人が多いんだと思います","ts":"1616056521.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qlS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33a32527-ce06-4821-a41d-8bdf517eb829","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"どっちかって言うと可逆か非可逆かの気分的な問題が大きいですね","ts":"1616056489.016800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tyf0E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d65fb84c-034f-43a8-b7bb-a56472191340","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ダウンロード販売で買うなら flac 買いたいマンです","ts":"1616056476.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9NK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be237d84-fcf5-4c91-a6bb-5870d3e6aea9","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"僕は mp3 320 と flac と wav をスピーカー\u0026amp;イヤホンで聴き比べて違いを認知できなかったので全部mp3にしてます","ts":"1616056423.015100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hAU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6922e213-e8a7-443c-b2eb-c29773c1f5ac","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"わかる、でもポータブル機にはYouTube Music経由の圧縮データだな、まあ現実的なのでそれで","ts":"1616056371.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"40IZM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28a0f7fa-5e3a-409b-ac00-cda4c0039b5a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"FLACにしてるとそこまで数がなくてもサイズは段違いにデカくなるんですよね\nかといってmp3で運用はしたくないのでしょうがない感はある","ts":"1616056329.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bKn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeff3e63-dd23-4a3b-af76-98542f1fc006","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"5評価と未評価だけ、か","ts":"1616056217.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gwE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ee56f9a-0d79-4044-83fd-00cc7955cf27","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"すべての曲に☆5段階の評価をつけて、5評価のものだけ iPod に入るようにして運用してます","ts":"1616056205.012000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PsRxN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"113c1846-5c3e-475b-8e93-ee3cf727eb1f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"バックアップ用のNextcloudがだいぶカツカツになってきてるのでオブジェクトストレージ使おうか悩んでる","ts":"1616056182.011400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mVw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e5a7277-d55a-439f-acbf-4426ab7de816","type":"message","user":"U1MLSLA87","text":"復旧は、不可能ですねぇ","ts":"1616056169.01110